# Copy to .env.local for dev; set the same keys in the Vercel project for prod.

# Powers the visitor Q&A agent (/api/ask) and the retriever agent
# (npm run gather). Without it, /api/ask returns 503 and the widget tells
# visitors to use the form instead — the site degrades, it does not break.
#
# Set a monthly spend limit on this key in the Anthropic Console. It is the
# real ceiling on agent cost; the in-process rate limiter only bounds the
# cheap abuse case.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
